---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import AssessmentOffer from '../../components/AssessmentOffer.astro';
import { speechContent, serviceInformationPath } from '../../data/speech-content';
import { url, phone } from '../../data/site';
---
<PageLayout path={serviceInformationPath} label="Speech service information" title="Speech Assessment & Service Information | Pinnacle Blooms" description="Dated source record for Pinnacle speech assessment duration, written reports, parent review and the FREE speech assessment offer. Updated 27 September 2026." shareImage={speechContent.image.source} imageAlt={speechContent.image.alt} imageCaption={speechContent.image.caption} citations={[url('/speech-aba-autism-assessments'),url('/assessments/pinnacle-special-speech-and-language-assessment')]} documentOnly>
  <article class="wrap service-record section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Pinnacle Blooms Network · Service information</p>
    <h1>What to expect from<br /><em>a speech assessment.</em></h1>
    <p class="record-intro">Pinnacle’s speech assessment and service information, updated on <time datetime="2026-09-27">27 September 2026</time>. Start with a FREE speech and language assessment. Call us to arrange an appointment at your preferred centre.</p>
    <dl class="service-facts">
      <div id="assessment"><dt>Assessment process</dt><dd>We listen to your observations, review relevant documents and use formal and informal assessment activities to understand your child’s communication.</dd></div>
      <div id="duration"><dt>Approximate duration</dt><dd>About one hour, depending on the child’s needs. The centre confirms the current process and duration.</dd></div>
      <div id="report"><dt>Written report</dt><dd>We’ll confirm when your written report will be ready. Our service guide allows a couple of days; timing is agreed for your appointment.</dd></div>
      <div id="parent-review"><dt>Therapy and parent review</dt><dd>Our service guide describes 40 minutes of therapy plus five minutes of parent review. We’ll confirm the applicable session structure with your centre.</dd></div>
      <div id="fees"><dt>Speech and language assessment</dt><dd><AssessmentOffer /><p>Pinnacle’s current offer: your speech and language assessment is FREE. Call 9100 181 181 to arrange your appointment. Ongoing therapy is priced separately; we explain the plan, fees and schedule before you enrol.</p></dd></div>
    </dl>
    <h2>Prepare for a useful conversation.</h2>
    <p>Bring relevant reports you already have, your questions and examples of communication at home or school. We’ll explain what else to bring, who will conduct the assessment, their qualifications, report timing, suitable next steps and fees for any ongoing therapy.</p>
    <div class="record-actions"><a class="button primary" href={phone.href}>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="button outline" href={url('/enroll#contact-form-title')}>Book your FREE assessment</a></div>
    <h2 id="provenance">Sources and record history</h2>
    <p>The assessment process, approximate duration, report and parent-review details are based on Pinnacle’s speech-service guide, reviewed on 27 September 2026. Your centre will explain the arrangements for your child’s appointment.</p>
    <p>Pinnacle confirmed the current FREE speech assessment offer and its ₹25,999 listed value on 27 September 2026. This offer supersedes earlier price information for this campaign.</p>
    <p><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/speech-service-information.json">Download the dated source record (JSON)</a> · <a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/speech-service-information.txt">Read the plain-text record</a></p>
    <p><a class="text-link" href={url(speechContent.path)}>Back to speech therapy →</a> · <a href={url('/verify/')}>Explore Pinnacle Verify →</a></p>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
